Paul would have been a really interesting thing to banter about while we were on set
如果当时我们在片场等灯光布置的时候能聊聊这个，

70
00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:39.690
waiting for lights to go up and stuff.
那一定会很有趣。

71
00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:40.790
He's holding back.
他藏着掖着呢。

72
00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.430
I did know he'd been to Russia.
我倒是知道他去过俄罗斯。

73
00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:42.790
Oh.
噢。

74
00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.590
So there you go.
所以你看。

75
00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:45.510
How was it?
怎么样？

76
00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:46.170
Was it great?
很棒吗？

77
