It was great.
很棒。

78
00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:48.790
He had a great, great time.
他玩得非常非常开心。

79
00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:57.290
Well, he said that he was so excited to be able to write and direct this episode because
他说他当时特别兴奋能编导这一集，因为

