00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:01.810
it featured the first visit to Dwight's farmhouse at Shroot FarMs.
这是剧中第一次出现德怀特的农舍——施鲁特农场。

81
00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:02.990
Because we've been there.
因为我们之前去过那儿。

82
00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:05.670
We saw the barn in the initiation and all that.
我们在《入会仪式》那一集里见过那个谷仓之类的。

83
00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:14.230
But he got to completely invent Dwight's home and what it looked like and all of that stuff.
但他这次可以完全凭空构想德怀特的家是什么样子的，以及所有相关的细节。

84
00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:20.930
And he said that he got the idea for Dwight to run a bed and breakfast during a trip to Italy
他说他想让德怀特经营一家民宿的想法，源于几年前

85
00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.390
a couple of years before.
去意大利旅行时的经历。

86
00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:23.650
He is a world traveler.
他真是个环球旅行家。

87
00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:24.990
He's well-traveled.
他去过很多地方。

88
00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:33.050
So while he was in Italy, he had seen a bunch of signs for this farm B&B stay.
在意大利的时候，他看到很多关于这种农场民宿的招牌。

89
00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:36.010
You go stay on people's farms in Italy.
你可以去意大利人的农场里住。

